                      (            os9.d):01038                             ORG       0
0000                  (            os9.d):01039         FMCREA              RMB       3                   Create (Open New) File
0003                  (            os9.d):01040         FMOPEN              RMB       3                   Open File
0006                  (            os9.d):01041         FMMDIR              RMB       3                   Make Directory
0009                  (            os9.d):01042         FMCDIR              RMB       3                   Change Directory
000C                  (            os9.d):01043         FMDLET              RMB       3                   Delete File
